AUTOMATIC CALLS (1/2): when?
A signal starts by itself, like the manual call, but with a SYMBOL in place of the dot:
- a heart or a half heart: your heart slot already holds a full heart, you can neither store nor merge it;
- the icon of an item: it is no stronger than what you wear, you do not pick it up;
- the icon of the accessory you just SWAPPED with {interact} (the old one, dropped at your feet);
- a RED CROSS: your HP are at 30% or less, you are asking for healing.
Romain talks a lot: his calls have no wait, and his red cross repeats every 3 s.
